@guide H_Zangarmarsh
@name Zangarmarsh (Zabra'jin)
@faction Horde
@levels 61-64
@zone Zangarmarsh
@chapter Outland
@desc Cenarion Refuge, Swamprat Post, Zabra'jin and Sporeggar. The Coilfang Reservoir dungeons are optional.
@next H_Terokkar

accept Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake | Ysiel Windsinger.
accept Warden Hamoot
accept The Umbrafen Tribe | Ikeyen, Cenarion Refuge.
complete The Umbrafen Tribe
complete Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake
turnin The Umbrafen Tribe
accept A Damp, Dark Place
accept Blessings of the Ancients | Windcaller Blackhoof.
complete Blessings of the Ancients | Speak to the ancients Ashyen and Keleth, right here at the Refuge.
turnin Blessings of the Ancients
accept Safeguarding the Watchers
accept Plants of Zangarmarsh | Lauranna Thar'well.
complete Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | 10 Unidentified Plant Parts drop from Zangarmarsh creatures as you quest.
turnin Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | Lauranna Thar'well; hand in whenever you are back with 10 parts.
accept Saving the Sporeloks
turnin Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake
accept As the Crow Flies | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete As the Crow Flies | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin As the Crow Flies
accept Balance Must Be Preserved
accept The Dying Balance | Lethyn Moonfire.
turnin Warden Hamoot
accept A Warm Welcome
complete A Warm Welcome | Naga Claws drops from Darkcrest Taskmaster, Rajah Haghazed and Rajis Fyashe and others.
complete A Damp, Dark Place | Ikeyen's Belongings: loot Ikeyen's Belongings.
complete Safeguarding the Watchers
complete Saving the Sporeloks
complete Balance Must Be Preserved
complete The Dying Balance | Elite: Boglash; bring help or skip.
turnin A Warm Welcome
turnin Safeguarding the Watchers
turnin A Damp, Dark Place
turnin Saving the Sporeloks
turnin The Dying Balance
turnin Balance Must Be Preserved
accept No More Mushrooms! | Magasha.
accept Menacing Marshfangs | Reavij.
accept Thick Hydra Scales | Zurai, Swamprat Post.
complete Thick Hydra Scales | Thick Hydra Scale drops from Fenclaw Thrasher, Mire Hydra and Mragesh and others.
complete No More Mushrooms! | Eel Filet drops from Umbrafen Eel.
complete Menacing Marshfangs
turnin Thick Hydra Scales
accept Searching for Scout Jyoba
fp Swamprat Post
turnin No More Mushrooms!
accept There's No Explanation for Fashion
accept A Job Undone
turnin Searching for Scout Jyoba
accept Jyoba's Report
turnin Menacing Marshfangs
accept The Respect of Another
complete There's No Explanation for Fashion | Diaphanous Wing drops from Blacksting, Marshlight Bleeder and Umbraglow Stinger and others.
complete A Job Undone
accept Report to Shadow Hunter Denjai
complete The Respect of Another | Blacksting's Stinger drops from Blacksting.
turnin Jyoba's Report
turnin The Respect of Another
turnin There's No Explanation for Fashion
turnin A Job Undone
accept The Zapthrottle Mote Extractor! | Mack Diver.
fp Zabra'jin
fp Cenarion Refuge
turnin Report to Shadow Hunter Denjai | Zabra'jin.
bind Zabra'jin [area=3645]
accept Stinging the Stingers | Gambarinka.
accept WANTED: Boss Grog'ak
accept Burstcap Mushrooms, Mon! | Witch Doctor Tor'gash.
accept Angling to Beat the Competition | Zurjaya.
complete WANTED: Boss Grog'ak | Boss Grog'ak's Head drops from Boss Grog'ak.
complete Burstcap Mushrooms, Mon! | Burstcap Mushroom: loot Burstcap Mushroom.
complete Stinging the Stingers
complete Angling to Beat the Competition
turnin Angling to Beat the Competition
accept The Biggest of Them All
accept Pursuing Terrorclaw
turnin Stinging the Stingers
accept The Sharpest Blades
turnin WANTED: Boss Grog'ak
accept Impending Attack
complete Impending Attack | Ango'rosh Attack Plans: loot Ango'rosh Attack Plans.
turnin Impending Attack
accept Us or Them
accept Message to the Daggerfen
complete Us or Them
complete Message to the Daggerfen
complete The Sharpest Blades | Marshfang Slicer Blade drops from "Count" Ungula and Marshfang Slicer.
complete The Biggest of Them All
complete Pursuing Terrorclaw
turnin Us or Them
turnin Message to the Daggerfen
turnin The Sharpest Blades
turnin The Biggest of Them All
turnin Pursuing Terrorclaw
turnin Burstcap Mushrooms, Mon!
turnin The Zapthrottle Mote Extractor! [optional]
accept Watcher Leesa'oh | From Lethyn Moonfire.
accept The Sporelings' Plight | Fahssn.
accept Natural Enemies
turnin Watcher Leesa'oh
accept Observing the Sporelings
complete Observing the Sporelings
complete The Sporelings' Plight | Mature Spore Sac: loot Mature Spore Sac.
complete Natural Enemies | Bog Lord Tendril drops from Bog Lord, Starving Fungal Giant and Withered Giant and others.
turnin Observing the Sporelings
accept A Question of Gluttony
complete A Question of Gluttony | Discarded Nutriment: loot Discarded Nutriment.
turnin A Question of Gluttony
turnin The Sporelings' Plight
turnin Natural Enemies
level 63
note Ride south from Zabra'jin into Terokkar Forest; Stonebreaker Hold is the Horde town. Shattrath is on the way.
